# M7 online: a desync (co-op). m1 changes its copy of the level behind the
# stream's back; the host's hash comparison reports it, m1 rebuilds its
# game by replaying every stream and is back in sync; everyone agrees at
# the end.
size 1280x720
# The first launch plays the intro: hold a key to skip it.
wait 150
hold enter 70
idle 400
@host online host private ${ROOMFILE}
@m1 online join code ${ROOMFILE}
@!m0,m1 online join invite ${ROOMFILE}
@host online wait 90 machines=${MACHINES}
@host online mode coop
online seats ${LOCALS}
online wait 90 online session
online wait 60 players=${PLAYERS}
online bots 3
online settle 30
@m1 online corrupt
online bots 3
online settle 60
@m1 shot 01-resynced
@host online end
online wait 90 online room
online expect agreed
online expect desync
@m1 online expect resynced
quit
